
---

## 🚫 PERFECT `.gitignore` (VERY IMPORTANT)

Create a file named **`.gitignore`** and paste this:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Virtual Environment
venv/
env/
.venv/

# IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Data files
attendance.csv

# Model files (optional: keep if needed)
# classifier.xml

# Temp files
tempCodeRunnerFile.py
